def max_fill(grid, capacity):
    total_drops = 0
    for well in grid:
        water_units = sum(well)
        # Calculate the number of drops needed for this well
        drops_needed = math.ceil(water_units / capacity)
        total_drops += drops_needed
    return total_drops
```

